      ],
      "fact": "Initializer/proof/source failure is saved as injectionError. A subsequent final-host false requirement runs before that error is rethrown. A true final host setting therefore replaces the original error with HOST_MICROPHONE_ENABLED_AFTER_ABORT, losing the earlier source/proof/RPC error and its potential gRPC code in current output."
    },
    {
      "clientLines": [
        277,
        292,
        301,
        318,
        320,
        333,
        339,
        342
      ],
      "fact": "RPC has fixed redacted transport/deadline/status/request errors and cancels the HTTP2 request on error. No per-method start time, bytes queued/written, original error stage or preserved secondary error is emitted in the current trial output. Available route/proof timestamps cannot reconstruct the lost source-call stage."
    }
